<view class="container merge-container">
  <view class="hero card">
    <view class="hero-title">合并 PC 端账号</view>
    <view class="hero-subtitle">输入您在 PC 端注册的邮箱和密码，合并后两端的单词本、错题、学习历史会自动同步。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="form-card card">
    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="label">PC 端邮箱</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        type="text"
        placeholder="例如：zhang@163.com"
        value="{{email}}"
        bindinput="onEmailInput"
        disabled="{{submitting}}"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="label">PC 端密码</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        password
        placeholder="请输入密码"
        value="{{password}}"
        bindinput="onPasswordInput"
        disabled="{{submitting}}"
      />
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="error-message">{{errorMessage}}</view>

    <button class="btn-primary merge-btn" bindtap="onSubmit" disabled="{{submitting}}">
      {{submitting ? '合并中...' : '合并'}}
    </button>

    <view class="form-tip">
      合并后：
      <text class="tip-line">· 当前小程序账号会被删除</text>
      <text class="tip-line">· PC 端账号会获得小程序端的所有数据</text>
      <text class="tip-line">· 您将在小程序以 PC 端账号身份登录</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="cancel-btn" bindtap="onCancel">暂不合并</view>
</view>
